    <!-- Help -->
    <string name="section_help">How to use</string>
    <string name="help_text">• Tap the button: launch the assistant.\n• Drag: move it anywhere; it snaps to the edge.\n• Long-press: hide it (bring it back from the notification or this screen).\n• Drag onto the ✕ at the bottom: close it.</string>
    <string name="help_note">Note: Android has no public API that lets third-party apps open Circle to Search directly. The button opens your default assistant through the official ACTION_ASSIST; from there you can use its screen features (Ask about screen, Translate, Search screen). If your device blocks it, the fallback target is used.</string>

